    e) Convey the object code using peer-to-peer transmission, provided
    you inform other peers where the work and Corresponding Source of
    the work are being offered, through the same peer-to-peer
    transmission, and provided the other peers follow the requirements
    of this License in conveying the work.

  A "Major Component" of a work means a component that, in the
